  <!-- ══════════════════════════════ PROJECTS ═══════════════════════════ -->
  {% if collections.projects and collections.projects.length > 0 %}
  <section id="projects" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">Selected work</p>
        <h2 class="text-reveal">Projects we're proud of.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="featured-projects-h">
        {% set shown = 0 %}
        {% for project in collections.projects | reverse %}
          {% set projectCover = project.data.cover or (project.data.gallery and project.data.gallery[0] and project.data.gallery[0].url) %}
          {% if shown < 4 and projectCover %}
          <a href="{{ project.url }}" class="fp-card reveal" data-parallax="0.04">
            <div class="fp-card-img">
              <img src="{{ projectCover }}" alt="{{ project.data.title }}" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="fp-card-info">
              {% if project.data.sector %}
              <span class="project-sector-tag fp-sector">{{ project.data.sector }}</span>
              {% endif %}
              <h3>{{ project.data.title }}</h3>
              {% if project.data.summary %}<p>{{ project.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
              {% if project.data.services %}
              <div class="project-card-tags">
                {% for svc in project.data.services %}
                  <span class="project-tag">{{ svc }}</span>
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
              {% endif %}
              <span class="project-card-link">View project →</span>
            </div>
          </a>
          {% set shown = shown + 1 %}
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="trust-cta reveal" style="margin-top:48px;">
        <a href="/projects/" class="btn btn-ghost magnetic">See all projects <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════ SERVICES ═══════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="services" class="section section-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">What we do</p>
        <h2 class="text-reveal">Design. Code. Visibility.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card reveal">
          <span class="service-num">01</span>
          <h3>Web Design &amp; Development</h3>
          <p>Custom-built websites that look sharp and load fast. Hand-coded, Webflow, or Shopify — no page builders, no shortcuts.</p>
          <ul class="service-tags">
            <li>Custom Code</li>
            <li>Webflow</li>
            <li>Shopify</li>
            <li>Responsive</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card reveal">
          <span class="service-num">02</span>
          <h3>Local SEO</h3>
          <p>Rank where it matters. We optimise your site for Google so the right clients in your area find you first — not your competitors.</p>
          <ul class="service-tags">
            <li>Local SEO</li>
            <li>Google Maps</li>
            <li>On-page SEO</li>
            <li>Analytics</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card reveal">
          <span class="service-num">03</span>
          <h3>Google Business Profile</h3>
          <p>Your Google listing, done properly. Setup, optimisation, review strategy — the details that build trust before anyone visits your site.</p>
          <ul class="service-tags">
            <li>Profile Setup</li>
            <li>Reviews</li>
            <li>Brand Identity</li>
            <li>Trust Signals</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card reveal">
          <span class="service-num">04</span>
          <h3>Google Ads &amp; Landing Pages</h3>
          <p>High-performance landing pages paired with targeted ad campaigns. Built to convert clicks into clients, not just traffic.</p>
          <ul class="service-tags">
            <li>Google Ads</li>
            <li>Landing Pages</li>
            <li>Conversion Tracking</li>
            <li>A/B Testing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════ PROCESS ════════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="process" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">How it works</p>
        <h2 class="text-reveal">Three steps. No jargon.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="process-list">
        <div class="process-step reveal">
          <div class="process-left">
            <span class="process-num">01</span>
          </div>
          <div class="process-right">
            <h3>Talk</h3>
            <p>A quick call to understand your business, your audience, and what success looks like. No jargon, no pressure — just a conversation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal">
          <div class="process-left">
            <span class="process-num">02</span>
          </div>
          <div class="process-right">
            <h3>Shape</h3>
            <p>We design, write, and build. You review. We refine until it feels right. The whole thing happens fast — most sites go from call to draft in under a week.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal">
          <div class="process-left">
            <span class="process-num">03</span>
          </div>
          <div class="process-right">
            <h3>Launch</h3>
            <p>Your site goes live — optimised, fast, and ready to rank. We handle hosting, DNS, and everything technical. You focus on your business.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════ CTA ════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="cta-section section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-inner reveal">
        <h2 class="text-reveal">Ready to build something <span class="gradient-text">worth showing?</span></h2>
        <p class="cta-sub">Tell us about your project. No pitch deck, no pressure — just a straight conversation about what great looks like for your business.</p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-lg magnetic">Start a conversation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ════════════════════════════════ FAQ ═════════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="faq" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">Common questions</p>
        <h2 class="text-reveal">Everything you want to know.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">

        <div class="faq-item reveal">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            Do I really need a website if I already get work through word of mouth?
            <span class="faq-icon"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Word of mouth is great — but it has a ceiling. A website means clients who've never heard of you can still find you. It also makes referrals easier: when someone recommends you, their contact Googles you next. If there's nothing there, they move on. A professional site backs up every recommendation you get.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item reveal">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            What's included in the website price?
            <span class="faq-icon"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Everything. Design, copywriting, development, mobile optimisation, contact forms, hosting setup, and basic on-page SEO are all included. You don't need to buy anything else or deal with any third-party providers. We handle the whole thing from start to finish.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item reveal">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            How long does it take to build my website?
            <span class="faq-icon"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>We deliver in 2 weeks from the moment we have everything we need from you. That includes a quick call to understand your business, a few photos if you have them, and basic business info. We handle the writing ourselves, so you don't need to provide copy — just answer our questions and we'll do the rest.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item reveal">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            What is Local SEO and do I need it?
            <span class="faq-icon"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Local SEO is the process of optimising your website so it ranks on Google when people in your area search for what you offer. For example: "electrician in Manchester" or "web designer near me". Without it, your site exists but nobody finds it. With it, you appear at the top of search results when local clients are actively looking to hire. For most growing companies, this is the single biggest driver of new enquiries.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item reveal">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            I'm not technical at all. Will I be able to manage my website?
            <span class="faq-icon"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>You won't need to. We handle everything — hosting, updates, maintenance. If you want to change something, just email or call us and we'll sort it. You focus on your trade; we take care of your website. There's no dashboard to learn, no plugins to update, no technical headaches.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item reveal">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            How quickly will I start getting enquiries from my website?
            <span class="faq-icon"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>It depends on your market and the services you choose. With Local SEO, most clients start seeing meaningful results within 4–8 weeks of launch. A professional website gives you a solid online presence immediately — great for when people are referred to you and look you up. For consistent inbound enquiries from Google, adding SEO is the most reliable path.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item reveal">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            Do you work with businesses outside Northamptonshire?
            <span class="faq-icon"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Yes — we work with companies across the whole of the UK. London, Manchester, Birmingham, Leeds, Bristol, and everywhere in between. Local SEO is done remotely and works the same regardless of where you're based. Get in touch and we'll talk through what's possible for your area.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item reveal">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            What happens after my website is live?
            <span class="faq-icon"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>We don't disappear after launch. You get included support, plus monthly ranking reports on a Local SEO plan. We're also available for ongoing updates, content changes, and strategy — either as one-off work or through an ongoing arrangement that includes regular SEO management and strategy calls.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

